<title>SINGAPORE: Haw Par unit in 13.3 mln ringgit venture.</title>
<headline>Haw Par unit in 13.3 mln ringgit venture.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Haw Par Brothers International Ltd said on Friday its Underwater World International Pte Ltd subsidiary had set up a joint venture agreement with a unit of Lion Corp Bhd to build a high-tech acquarium.</p>
<p>The joint venture company Mahkota Seaworld Sdn Bhd will develop the acquarium in the Malaysian town of Malacca at a cost of about 13.3 million ringgit, Haw Par said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the project was due to be completed in about 18 months and would involve a total equity investment of 6.75 million ringgit, to be shared in a 60:40 proportion between Underwater World and the Lion unit, Ayer Keroh Resort Sdn Bhd.  </p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
